# Generated, not written. `openapi.json` is the API's published spec and
# `lib/api-schema.ts` is produced from it by `npm run api:types`; formatting
# either one means the next regeneration reverts the change.
openapi.json
lib/api-schema.ts

# Prose is hand-wrapped, not machine-wrapped. Every Markdown file here is
# wrapped to a deliberate measure and uses `*emphasis*` and indented fences;
# Prettier rewrites all three. This matches `dileepa-dev`, which ignores
# Markdown for the same reason — several of these files are the same governance
# documents, copied between the repositories.
*.md

